        "category": "plugin",
        "severity": "error",
        "description": "Express optional Effect work with a conditional yield inside Effect.gen or Effect.fn. A Match branch that returns Effect.void represents skipped work rather than a selected value. Keep the condition and the dependent work inside the same operation so they run at the original time. Use Match for pure value selection.",
